TextView.android:text:
Dear Paramedics Unit, this is an emergency alert call for required urgent assistance about a serious fall of my patient {Var PatNam + Var PatSurname }, of age {Var PatAge}, Mobile Number {Var PatMobile}, with fall vital signs recording of {Var PatOtherVitSigns},

    (if Var PatHeartRate not null and Heart Rate Rate Reading {Var PatHeartRate})

    at the moment of fall detect {Var DateDetected}, {Var TimeDetected}.

    (If Var PatSpecificMedCon not Null Please, Note the patient has the following specific medical condition {Var PatSpecificMedCon})

    (If Var PatAllergy not Null The Patient has the following Allergy {Var PatAllergy})

    As patient's doctor, my notes in case in emergency are as follows: {LongVar EmergencyNotText}

    Patient's Next of Kin Name and Mobile Number: {Var NextofKinNam}, {Var NextofKinMobile}

    Patient's Caregiver Name and Mobile Number: {Var CareNam + VarCareSurnam}, {Var CareMobile}

    Yours, Sincerely
    Doctor {Var DocName + Var DocSurnam}, {Var DocMobile}

    Date of Notification: { SysDate}
    Time of Notification: { SysTime}
    Dear Paramedics Unit, this is an emergency alert call for required urgent assistance about a serious fall of my patient {Var PatNam + Var PatSurname }, of age {Var PatAge}, Mobile Number {Var PatMobile}, with fall vital signs recording of {Var PatOtherVitSigns},

    (if Var PatHeartRate not null and Heart Rate Rate Reading {Var PatHeartRate})

    at the moment of fall detect {Var DateDetected}, {Var TimeDetected}.

    (If Var PatSpecificMedCon not Null Please, Note the patient has the following specific medical condition {Var PatSpecificMedCon})

    (If Var PatAllergy not Null The Patient has the following Allergy {Var PatAllergy})

    As patient's doctor, my notes in case in emergency are as follows: {LongVar EmergencyNotText}

